  B. Yes, because it turns out Granite City was making false insurance claims.
  C. No, because the Actuarvac was a highly flawed machine.
  D. Yes, because Madison had to eventually investigate the city.
  Gold answer: A (1)

Q5: According to Dr. Parnell, can the same fate affecting Granite City affect other places around the world?
  A. Yes, because the granite being shipped to other places out of Granite City is what is causing the problems for the people.
  B. No, because the people of Granite City are born with the mental problems that are plaguing them and cannot spread them.
  C. Yes, because there are other places in the world exporting this same type of granite.
  D. Yes, because Madison is already experiencing the same mental problems the people are having.
