  B. The physicians are known to be brutal and sometimes kill patients from planets that aren’t under contract
  C. The cost may be extremely expensive for emergency services outside of the contract, taking centuries to repay
  D. Their biology is not understood well, and mistakes can be made
  Gold answer: D (4)

Q12: How many people die during the events of the story?
