Q13: How many planets have medical service contracts with Earth?
  A. Over one hundred
  B. About fifty
  C. One
  D. Unknown
  Gold answer: D (4)

Q14: What were some of the treatments the Doctors tried on His Eminence?
  A. Oral medicine, cold bath
