  B. It meant the Doctors knew it was a place they should not treat any patients due to their lack of knowledge with their kind
  C. It meant the Doctors had the option to refuse their call for hospital services
  D. They got a priority position in the emergency queue due to their planet’s class
  Gold answer: A (1)
